### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Upsert user goal
POST http://localhost:4000/api/user-goal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "goal": "fat_loss",
  "notes": "Prefer simple meals on workdays."
}

### Upsert daily health summary
POST http://localhost:4000/api/health-summary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "date": "2026-04-26",
  "steps": 8123,
  "activeEnergyKcal": 512,
  "workoutCount": 1,
  "workoutMinutes": 38,
  "workoutEnergyKcal": 275,
  "sleepHours": 6.9,
  "restingHeartRateBpm": 58,
  "hrvMs": 44,
  "weightKg": 78.4,
  "heightCm": 178
}

### Get one summary
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health-summary/demo-user/2026-04-26

### Get 7-day range
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health-summary/demo-user?days=7

### Generate diet recommendation
POST http://localhost:4000/api/diet-recommendation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "demo-user",
  "date": "2026-04-26"
}
